<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ENGLAND, RETAIN ASHES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT ENGLAND, RETAIN ASHES.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia retained</p>
<p>the Ashes when they beat England by 264 runs on the fourth day</p>
<p>of the fifth test on Sunday to take a 3-1 lead in the six-match</p>
<p>series.</p>
<p>Scores: England 313 and 186, Australia 427 and 336.</p>
<p>Sixth and final test at The Oval on August 21-25.</p>
